        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Breakfast at the hotel. The day is free for you to explore independently or take an optional excursion.\n\n**Tigre and northern Buenos Aires:** shared excursion with an English-speaking guide, $100 per person.\n\n**Montevideo:** full-day shared excursion with an English-speaking guide, $500 per person.\n\nA private trip for a minimum of 2 people with an English-speaking guide costs $850 per person.\n\nFerry tickets are included.\n\n**Fiesta Gaucha:** full-day shared excursion with an English-speaking guide, $320 per person.\n\nA traditional Argentine lunch is included.\n\nThe excursion lasts about 8 hours."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_label:7a611df869cde5d6",
