      },
      "text": "Buenos Aires – Mendoza"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:ec46e3209ab74818",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "4703d6af17e3b2845bc84cf5e70bad864fae67c9446968570a9ea42cf3a1f309",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261107-6cc062915871",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Transfer to the airport for your flight to Mendoza, then transfer to the hotel.\n\n**Mendoza city tour**\n\nYou can book an optional private sightseeing tour of Mendoza for a minimum of 2 people with an English-speaking guide, $200 per person."
